OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Frain or showers this evening, with
OL,7,Fsome heavy outbreaks especially in
OL,8,Fsouthwest. Drier and clearer spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping overnight, with just the
OL,10,Fodd shower.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FSunny intervals and showers,
OL,13,Fthe showers quite heavy but passing
OL,14,Fthrough quickly. Best of the sunshine
OL,15,Ffor East Lothian and eastern Borders.
OL,16,FFresh to strong west or southwest
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
