OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fwith occasional showers and easing
OL,7,Fwinds on Saturday, rain later. Windy
OL,8,Fwith some showers on Sunday. Bright
OL,9,Fstart Monday then increasingly heavy
OL,10,Fshowers.
